tools.description:
List projects in a workspace.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__kaneo_local__list_projects(args: {
  // Include archived projects
  includeArchived?: boolean;
  // Workspace ID
  workspaceId: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Search across tasks, projects, workspaces, comments, and activities.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__kaneo_local__search(args: {
  // Maximum results, 1 to 50. Defaults to 20.
  limit?: number;
  // Limit to one project
  projectId?: string;
  // Search query
  q: string;
  // Restrict results to one kind. Defaults to all.
  type?: "all" | "tasks" | "projects" | "workspaces" | "comments" | "activities";
  // Limit to one workspace
  workspaceId?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

Assign a task to a workspace member, or pass a null userId to unassign it.

exec tool declaration:
